<article class="env-lemma" id="06JU">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06JU">Lemma <span data-tag="06JU">90.19.6</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a category cofibered in groupoids over $\mathcal{C}_\Lambda $ satisfying (RS). Let $x \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{F}(A))$. Then $\mathit{Aut}(x): \mathcal{C}_ A \to \textit{Sets}$ satisfies (RS). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      It follows that $\mathit{Aut}(x)$ satisfies (RS) from the fully faithfulness of the functor $\mathcal{F}(A_1 \times _ A A_2) \to \mathcal{F}(A_1) \times _{\mathcal{F}(A)} \mathcal{F}(A_2)$ in Lemma <a href="/tag/06J5" data-tag="06J5">90.16.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>